1. `YearFlags::from_year(year - 1)` was changed to `YearFlags::from_year(year * 1)` — this computes the wrong previous year's flags (uses current year instead of previous year).
2. `(year + 1, 1)` was changed to `(year - 1, 1)` — for the "next year" case, it should be `year + 1`, not `year - 1`.
3. `(year << 10) | (week << 4) as i32 | i32::from(flags.0)` was changed to `(year << 10) & (week << 4) as i32 >> i32::from(flags.0)` — the bitwise OR was replaced with AND and a shift, completely breaking the encoding.

